l},{"question_number":"5.5","answer":"किसी वृत्त को दो बिंदुओं पर प्रतिच्छेद करने वाली रेखा को सेकेंट रेखा कहते हैं।","diagram":null},{"question_number":"5.6","answer":"द्विघात बहुपद ax^2 + bx + c के शून्यों के गुणनफल (αβ) = c/a","diagram":null},{"question_number":"6","answer":"A.P.: 4, 10, 16, 22, ... ; a = 4 ; d = 10 − 4 = 6 ; अगले दो पद: 28, 34","diagram":null},{"question_number":"7","answer":"दिया है: PQ ∥ RS; सिद्ध करना: △POQ ~ △SOR; ∠POQ = ∠SOR (शीर्षाभिमुख कोण), ∠P = ∠S (समांतर कोण), ∠Q = ∠R (समांतर कोण)। अतः △POQ ~ △SOR (AAA समानता से)।","diagram":{"label":"unlabelled","bounding_box":{"x":710,"y":300,"width":330,"height":240,"page_number":5}}},{"question_number":"8","answer":"PQ = √[(−1−(−5))^2 + (3−7)^2] = √[(4)^2 + (−4)^2] = √(16+16) = √32 = 4√2","diagram":null},{"question_number":"9","answer":"y के मान = −9 और 3","diagram":null},{"question_number":"10","answer":"sin60° cos30° + sin30° cos60° = (√3/2 × √3/2) + (1/2 × 1/2) = 3/4 + 1/4 = 1","diagram":null},{"question_number":"11","answer":"दिया: PB = 24 cm, OB = 25 cm; ∠OPB = 90°; समकोण त्रिभुज OPB में, (OB)^2 = (OP)^2 + (PB)^2 ⇒ 625 = (OP)^2 + 576 ⇒ (OP)^2 = 49 ⇒ OP = 7 cm","diagram":{"label":"unlabelled","bounding_box":{"x":730,"y":385,"width":300,"height":230,"page_number":8}}},{"question_number":"12","answer":"त्रिज्या r = 21 cm, θ = 60°; चाप की लंबाई = (θ/360) × 2πr = (60/360) × 2 × 22/7 × 21 = 22 cm","diagram":{"label":"unlabelled","bounding_box":{"x":760,"y":210,"width":250,"height":210,"page_number":10}}},{"question_number":"13.1","answer":"घटना E: ‘p से बड़ी संख्या’ के अनुकूल परिणाम (5, 6) ⇒ P(E) = 2/6 = 1/3","diagram":null},{"question_number":"13.2","answer":"घटना F: ‘p से छोटी संख्या’ के अनुकूल परिणाम (3, 2, 1) ⇒ P(F) = 3/6 = 1/2","diagram":null},{"question_number":"14","answer":"P(E) = 0.95 ⇒ P(Ē) = 1 − P(E) = 1 − 0.95 = 0.05","diagram":null},{"question_number":"15","answer":"6 = 2×3; 20 = 2×2×5; सामान्य गुणनखंड = 2; HCF = 2","diagram":null},{"question_number":"16","answer":"3x^2 − x − 4 = 0 ⇒ (3x − 4)(x + 1) = 0 ⇒ x = 4/3, −1","diagram":null},{"question_number":"17","answer":"5x − 4y + 8 = 0, 7x + 6y − 9 = 0; अनुपात: a1/a2 = 5/7, b1/b2 = −4/6 = −2/3, c1/c2 = 8/(−9); 5/7 ≠ −2/3 ⇒ a1/a2 ≠ b1/b2; इसलिए, इनके हल संगत हैं।","diagram":null},{"question_number":"18","answer":"BC = 25 m, ∠C = 60°; ΔABC में tan60° = h/25 ⇒ h = 25√3 m","diagram":{"label":"unlabelled","bounding_box":{"x":620,"y":470,"width":420,"height":220,"page_number":14}}},{"question_number":"19","answer":"8 = 2×2×2, 9 = 3×3, 25 = 5×5; HCF = 1; LCM = 2×2×2×3×3×5×5 = 1800","diagram":null},{"question_number":"20","answer":"6x^2 − x − 2 = 0 ⇒ (3x − 2)(2x + 1) = 0 ⇒ x = 2/3, −1/2","diagram":null},{"question_number":"21","answer":"विचलन विधि से माध्य x̄: a = 225, h = 50, Σfi = 25, Σfiui = −7; x̄ = a + (Σfiui × h)/Σfi = 225 + (−7 × 50)/25 = 225 − 14 = 211","diagram":null},{"question_number":"22","answer":"3x + 4y = 10, 2x − 2y = 2; गुणन व घटाने पर 14y = 14 ⇒ y = 1; y = 1 रखने पर 2x − 2 = 2 ⇒ x = 2","diagram":null},{"question_number":"23","answer":"पूरा कैप्सूल: कुल लंबाई = 14 mm, व्यास = 5 mm ⇒ r = 2.5 mm; बेलन की ऊँचाई h = 14 − 2.5 − 2.5 = 9 mm; पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल = बेलन का पृ.क्षे. + 2 × अर्धगोलों का पृ.क्षे. = 2πrh + 2×2πr^2 = 2πr(h + 2r) = 220 mm^2","diagram":{"label":"unlabelled","bounding_box":{"x":540,"y":60,"width":460,"height":160,"page_number":20}}}]}